        },
        {
          "text": "“Siida inyas ghwalas gheang'da soomjeandaanyi, was ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda, ak gwasawan, abeeda gaygwasiksa soomjeanda gawa aba badayda gheang'daanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.26",
