          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Heeyda inyas ghang'uda gujaweeda siida was ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda ak gameewa duwaawi, abeeda heeyda gajeefta lagheanga ea ghami, ak banyeagaaschi ea majeayaak, ak siida bea heeyda ea majeergweaksa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak heewi ghayi iibean gang'utu, ak ea sirukusa seabwa ng'asheanji, ak ea maduupeena gil, ak iidu gwanuus siida was ng'eedeeda ghana ea gatmooda, abeeda heewi gajeefta lagheanga ea ghami, ak eara siida bea heewiin gajeenuus. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iideepa eaghwalda leadeeda aba badaydaanyi, abeeda gayghoadayda aba badayda giitinooda eaweagaaschi aba gida wassean siyiin badaydaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Heeyda inyas ghang'uda gujaweeda orjeeda ghana huda, ak gwasawan, geatinda jea eabwat aba deaweeda diida gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 21:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iing'ut soomjeanda was ng'eedeeda ghana gatmooda, abeeda seabwa gayghoadaw siida haw bea soomjeanda shiliingaji diktam ea damanamughuush, ak heeyda gajeefta lagheanga ea ghami.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.21.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.21.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
