          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gabearji heewbwa siyagi ea ghami niirja, abeeda gajeeshaayda diida duu gwandean, ak geelaja lapiya ak heeydida meahiin gajeelaja. ",
          "type": "text",
