        {
          "text": "Ghana iisinal gideaba heeyda ghayi gabean gang'utu, nea seabwa ea maduupeena gil, abeeda gayghawalda heeyda hoorgeeda heeyda, ak heeyda meah gajeadaanyi gil.",
